BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:51 Steps to Freedom
DTSTART:20260714T190000Z
DTEND:20260714T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260701T073553Z
UID:1841aad9-0467-5745-b798-dd2d6ed4937b
DESCRIPTION:In Washington\, D.C.\, 51 Steps to Freedom has created “the 
 world’s largest outdoor museum\,” virtually. Celebrate the 250th anniv
 ersary of the United States by hearing about this initiative dedicated to 
 highlighting the historical narratives of individuals and movements that c
 ontributed to the development of our nation using a unique\, place-based a
 ugmented reality format.\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthc
 lub.org/events/2026-07-14/51-steps-freedom
LOCATION:The Commonwealth Club of California\, Toni Rembe Rock Auditorium\
 , San Francisco\, CA
