BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Connected to Place: Regenerating Nature\, Community\, and Local Ec
 onomies through Systems Change
DTSTART:20260805T003000Z
DTEND:20260805T023000Z
DTSTAMP:20260701T073553Z
UID:a96bcf8f-f6fd-5ef9-b539-77ca11ad44f6
DESCRIPTION:Join Matt Biggar\, Ph.D.\, for a lively discussion of his new 
 book\, Connected to Place: Regenerating Nature\, Community\, and Local Eco
 nomies Through Systems Change\, followed by the introduction of Transformi
 ng Our Region\, a new Member-led Forum at Commonwealth Club World Affairs.
  This new forum will apply the systems change approach featured in Connect
 ed to Place to the Bay Area through expert presentations and interactive a
 ctivities. \n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/even
 ts/2026-08-04/connected-place-regenerating-nature-community-and-local-econ
 omies-through-systems
