DTEND:20260807T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20260701T073553Z
UID:ed3532a0-8811-52aa-98a9-3163bb5068a7
DESCRIPTION:Join historian Emily Sneff for a presentation on the story beh
 ind the Declaration of Independence and how its message was shared in 1776
 .\nDrawing on her latest research\, Dr Sneff will explore how news of inde
 pendence spread across the colonies and beyond\, offering fresh insights i
 nto this pivotal moment in American history. This in-person event provides
  a wonderful opportunity to hear from the author and deepen your understan
 ding of the nation’s founding.\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commo
 nwealthclub.org/events/2026-08-06/author-event-when-declaration-independen
 ce-was-news-emily-sneff
LOCATION:Lafayette Public Library\, Don Tatzin Auditorium\, Lafayette\, CA
