 tion of one of history’s most powerful sentences: “We hold these truth
 s to be self-evident\, that all men are created equal\, that they are endo
 wed by their Creator with certain unalienable Rights\, that among these ar
 e Life\, Liberty\, and the pursuit of Happiness.”Drafted by Thomas Jeffe
 rson and edited by Benjamin Franklin and John Adams\, this line lays the f
 oundation for the American Dream and defines the common ground we share as
  a nation. \n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/even
